  <p class="eyebrow text-secondary">Comfort during treatment</p>
  <h2 id="sedation-callout-title">Ask about sedation for your visit.</h2>
  <p>If anxiety makes treatment difficult, ask whether sedation is right for you. Nitrous oxide is provided by Dr. Moore. IV sedation is administered and monitored by a board-eligible anesthesiologist. All patients are welcome, and Missouri Medicaid is accepted for sedation cases.</p>
